Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拓真好強啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.43,0:00:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三人組隊的話 這點怪物小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的裝備也分給你們吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有好多呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們是夥伴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.07,0:00:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「因為我們是夥伴啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙真是太逗了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算啦 反正還免費送裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裝備也太強了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩個人刷怪也輕輕鬆鬆！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不帶拓真也無所謂了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無所謂！無所謂！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是做夢啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太 太近了吧 你們倆！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然真是豔福不淺啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:24.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}塞がれた過去から抜け出して
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:29.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}次の場所へ思い走らせる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:35.15,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}辿り著く場所なんてなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.37,0:01:40.94,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}今日の涙が星になる日まで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:52.56,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1273.333,10)\fs36.667\blur2\fad(100,100)}２つの　小さな命が燃えている
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:43.82,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}君は僕のよう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:46.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}僕は君のよう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.65,0:01:51.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)\pos()}違うのに同じ　背中合わせだね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:59.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}覚醒の果に　決意輝けて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:02:00.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1273.333,6.667)\fs36.667\blur2\fad(100,100)}Go into the brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:02.33,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}負けたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:03.98,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}逃げたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不可能なんて信じない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:11.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}奪い奪われる日々は要らない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:14.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}夢を見て　夢に愛され
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.87,0:02:17.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}新たなる光になる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:22.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}優しさだけじゃ誰も守れないならば
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:28.82,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}本當の強さを知りたいから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:24.22,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}突破過去的重重封鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:29.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}向著彼岸　一往無前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:35.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}就算道路永無止境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.37,0:01:40.94,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}今日的淚水終將化為星辰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:52.56,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(1273.333,703.333)\blur2\fs36.667\fad(100,100)}一對微小的生命　在此刻燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:43.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}你中有我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:46.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}我中有你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.65,0:01:51.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}雖截然不同　卻並肩作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:59.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}決意指向　覺醒的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:02.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不想認輸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:03.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不願逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}相信事事皆有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:11.58,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}遠離爭鬥的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:14.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}懷抱夢想　深愛希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.87,0:02:17.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}成為新的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:22.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}只有溫柔　無法守護
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:28.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}那就去找到　真正的強大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.09,0:02:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去跟希比和賽勒絲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知會昨天奇拉王子的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去向領主加爾弗德大人報告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上多小心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多小心的人是你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒險者們也許還會襲擊你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:02:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇拉王子也還會來聽你的答覆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請一定不要大意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.44,0:03:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是誰來 我都不會把雪拉交出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要果斷拒絕哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切就都結束啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不會發生戰爭！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿下報酬 任務就圓滿完成啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次雖然避免了戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我還是覺得 要時刻做好準備
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算重現 我那個世界的藥水
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害！藥水嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王非一日可成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身為強者 更不能疏於這些基本的準備
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 這要怎麼做啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和「十字幻想曲」的貼圖又不太一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要混合起來就行了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會吵你的！能讓我看看嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:04:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我會壓力山大！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一丁點就能窺見精靈的至寶了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起藥水
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我更想要潤滑液啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在說什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波 濤 胸 湧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼快就能做好啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然做好了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看過專業人士製作藥水
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都沒你這麼快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在乳搖了三下的時間裡做出了藥水
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 下意識地動手操作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然自己是毫無知識的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要將注意力轉移到別的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能變成遊戲裡的頂級熟練調和師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一瞬間做好藥水嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不做了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 還要做…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好好看著吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是冒險者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就有必要學習做藥水
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.97,0:05:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔細盯著我的手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！我看著呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也看著呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Q彈嫩滑…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一點就能看見頭頭了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害啊 熟練調和師！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身為魔王 這是理所當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.71,0:05:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是第一次看到這麼操作的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼什麼都會 迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅笑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎麼可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你平時都擺出一副恐怖的表情呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該死！大意了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡迪亞布羅剛才的表情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對！就是這表情！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在來這個世界之前 我從沒這樣被人開玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才能不用扮演魔王 普普通通地說話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望 這樣的時光…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能一直繼續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在害羞什麼啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害羞的魔王就不是魔王了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅還會說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說 迪亞布羅…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉 怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 迪亞布羅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有件事 要跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要回古林伍德王國了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等、等…喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在這樣下去是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古林伍德是我的故鄉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不應該在這浪費時間 要回去為王族盡力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾 蕾姆呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用跟她告別嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起告別 我要快點回到哥哥身邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來 雪拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道 你一定會回我身邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說好了我們都要尊重雪拉的決定吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼這麼沒精打采
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉回古林伍德了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎麼做？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉不是會撒謊的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天她明明說過不會回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我哪裡惹到她了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望 這樣的時光 能一直繼續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要頹廢到什麼時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去救她嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個白癡精靈 是不懂演戲的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要是懂的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能領會更多東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:50.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腦子缺根筋 記性差得很
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也不會撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:10:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她昨天晚上 還和我談到了將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然聽起來不太現實
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但很有她的風格 是個可愛的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她的夢想中 有我 也有迪亞布羅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不覺得這樣的她 會離開我們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有可能被施下了操縱意識的魔法呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情 我當然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇拉來的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又吹起了笛子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從那之後 雪拉就不對勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的笛子 也許有什麼魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是「十字幻想曲」中沒有這樣的笛子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.31,0:10:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的是 我沒有證據
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果 還是和從前一樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我單方面以為大家都是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自作多情的誤會別人對我也有好感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是覺得這一切都是被拋棄者的可悲妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:11:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我的一廂情願
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…相信雪拉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不是被施下魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.49,0:11:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也一定是昏了頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去把雪拉帶回來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再被拒絕 不想再受傷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不想被他人左右自己的感情！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾姆應該也是這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 我是雪拉的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我現在是迪亞布羅和蕾姆的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅？你要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！就只有蕾姆嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是你的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說 迪亞布羅…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望這樣的時光 能一直繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 蕾姆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,單槍匹馬闖進精靈的地盤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不能保證全身而退
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.16,0:12:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再見到雪拉一面 我就絕不會放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個有趣的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就為了見見那個擅自離開的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要面對如此高難度的挑戰？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾姆·嘉蕾鄔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,召喚我的其中一人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你渴求魔王的力量嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔王迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了完成你的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓你見識下 我這強大力量的片鱗半爪！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一同前去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉西亞小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉小姐的事 我也無法釋然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼做 也許會讓你失去國家騎士的地位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想守護的 不是自己的地位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是需要幫助的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不能丟下蕾姆大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.89,0:13:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉西亞小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明明說過 你不需要派上什麼用場
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙 看來還挺喜歡自找麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:36.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！我們走！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要從愚蠢王子手中 奪回雪拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別做無謂的掙扎了 雪拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道這笛子是我們一族的秘寶吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天見面的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就以只有精靈能聽見的聲音 把魔法施加在笛聲中了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.36,0:14:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經無法違抗這笛子了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能夠隨意改寫 你的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那表情真是傑作啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.01,0:14:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果卻慘遭背叛的混魔族！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 雪拉 我要改寫了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會乖乖回答我的問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你問吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.41,0:14:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅要求你做了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對你下了什麼命令？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命令？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他用隸從項圈對你下了不少命令吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他讓你做了什麼樣的侍奉？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.51,0:14:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會讓你做更厲害的事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:14:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命令？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只命令過我一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我和蕾姆握手 保持笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能只是這樣吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的沒有再被命令過了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你也逃不掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會讓你的身體牢牢記住…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是屬於誰的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的聲音是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該死 我正要開始享受…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是史萊姆而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會被融化吃掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉食系的話是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這種只吃纖維
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:16:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要融化我的衣服做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.81,0:16:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那還用問嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是為了準備傳宗接代
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好熱！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺好像被大大的舌頭舔了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡膝蓋內側嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個騷貨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只覺得好噁心！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,區區雪拉還挺努力的嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最討厭哥哥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別惹毛我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然在傳宗接代前我就會把你殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要被你淩辱 我還不如去死！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你還能嘴硬到幾時
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個聒噪的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 我就幫你改寫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你想將一切奉獻給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我 迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你久等了 雪拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.44,0:17:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闖入公務中的王子陣中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想幹什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公務 這叫公務嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此無恥下流
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是王族 也無法饒恕！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:17:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這只是助興節目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:18:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論男女 都得有點情調吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然 是我錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候 我就該不惜將城市化作火海
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要把雪拉留下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我來遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪亞布羅…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的…你真的來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這扯什麼友情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然沒發現入侵者？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,護衛們都是幹什麼吃的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒聽見外頭的聲音嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這什麼情況？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,護衛們都去哪了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇拉大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道自己幹了些什麼嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是國際問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引發戰爭也無所謂嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是來確定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉是不是真的想回國
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用惡毒的手段操縱了雪拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,證據呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什麼證據？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要證據
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只需要再問問雪拉的心意就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉！說啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你該做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回到古林伍德去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古林伍德是我的故鄉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不應該在這浪費時間 要回去為王族盡力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你清醒點！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她都這麼說了 你滿足了吧 混魔族？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以隸從項圈主人之名命令你！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:20:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不受任何魔法拘束 將你內心真正的想法說出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉大人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 雪拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要被迷惑！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.99,0:20:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改寫！改寫！改寫！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉大人！不要輸啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說出你的真心話 雪拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是屬於我的 雪拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的真實心意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要自由！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和迪亞布羅 和蕾姆 永永遠遠在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對我來說 夥伴才是最重要的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你應該受到制裁 奇拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廢物 廢物 廢物！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個個都讓我這麼火大！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直一點意思都沒有！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,區區愚民 囂張什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥！不可以用那只召喚獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要判你們全體死刑！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精靈族的秘寶 能破壞這個世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓我開心的這個世界 乾脆毀滅掉吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.09,0:21:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有膽量挑戰我 你就準備好面對相應的懲罰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出來吧 召喚九頭蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊 迪亞布羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是絕對贏不了那召喚獸的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是精靈的鎮國之寶啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太遲了 等著後悔吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受死吧 混魔族！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:09.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}むしゃくしゃな心の中　痛いんだ　これはきっと...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:11.95,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}これはきっと...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:29.20,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}隣にいると胸が苦しくなって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.11,0:22:33.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}ため息だって出ちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:40.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}ねぇもっと教えて好きな場所とか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.40,0:22:43.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}ついでに好きなタイプとか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:50.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}誰に言われてもう止まれない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:57.95,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}だって仕方がない　これが戀だ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:02.68,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}朝起きてあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:07.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}最悪な日でもあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:12.95,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}會えなくてもあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:18.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}もしも生まれ変わってもあなたが好き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:23.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:28.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:09.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{blur3\fad(100,100)}心煩意亂　隱隱作痛　這一定是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:11.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{blur3\fad(100,100)}這一定是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:29.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}在你身旁　就苦悶不已
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.11,0:22:33.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}不住發出歎息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:40.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}能不能告訴我　你喜歡去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.40,0:22:43.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}順便請問　你喜歡什麼類型呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:50.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}任誰也無法阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:57.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}無可奈何　這就是愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:02.68,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}早上醒來　就想著你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:07.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}糟糕的日子裡　也愛著你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:12.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}就算見不到面　也還惦記你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:18.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}到了下輩子　也還是喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:23.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:28.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,100)}Darlin', make me happy lalala I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是何方神聖？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你犯下的種種罪行 就以死償還吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.52,0:23:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇拉大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼被原諒 也太輕巧了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第八集 英雄猛進
